### 🟢 LOW SEVERITY

#### 10. General Fixture (Over-broad Setup)
**File:** `OrderProcessorTests.cs` · **Method:** `Setup()` (line 19) — class-level, affects all 8 non-clean tests

```csharp
private FakeLogger _logger = null!;

[TestInitialize]
public void Setup()
{
    _logger = new FakeLogger();  // ← initialized but never referenced by any test
}
```

**Problem:** `_logger` is constructed for every test but used by zero of the 9 test methods. Every test pays the initialization cost for an object it doesn't need.

**Fix:** Remove `_logger` from the shared fixture. Add it only to tests that need it:
```csharp
// Remove from class fields and [TestInitialize]
// Add locally only where needed:
[TestMethod]
public void SomeFutureTest_ThatNeedsLogging()
{
    var logger = new FakeLogger();
    var processor = new OrderProcessor(_db, _email, _inventory, logger);
    // ...
}
```

